{
  "info": {
    "name": "Hotel Management System API",
    "description": "REST API for the Hotel Management System (auth, rooms, reservations, guests, billing, admin payments report, dashboard, and a public no-auth guest booking flow). Staff auth uses an httpOnly session cookie set on login — Postman's cookie jar handles it automatically for requests against {{baseUrl}}'s host, no manual token needed. The 'Public Booking' folder needs no login at all.\n\nQuick start:\n1. Run 'Auth > Login (Admin)' (or Login (Front Desk)).\n2. Run requests under Room Types / Rooms / Guests to create data, or rely on the seeded demo data.\n3. Many 'create' requests auto-save their returned id into collection variables (e.g. {{roomId}}, {{guestId}}, {{reservationId}}, {{folioId}}, {{publicRoomId}}, {{publicReservationId}}) via a test script, so later requests in the folder chain together.\n4. 'Billing > List all payments (Admin)' gives a consolidated view of every payment with the services/charges it covered.\n5. 'Public Booking' requests need no login — a guest checks availability and books with just name/email/phone, no staff involvement.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:4000/api/v1" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "roomTypeId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "roomId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "guestId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "reservationId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "folioId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "lineItemId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "invoiceId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "publicRoomId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "publicReservationId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@hotel.local\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Seeded admin account. Sets an httpOnly session cookie."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Front Desk)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"frontdesk@hotel.local\",\n  \"password\": \"staff123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Seeded front-desk (non-admin) account."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get current user (me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "me"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users (Admin)",
